          "args" : [ ]
          } ]
        }

## Get report status [GET /custom/{id}]
Get the status of a report that is currently processing

**Response JSON body attributes (list may not be exhaustive):**

`list[(Object)]`:
- id `(String)`:  unique identifier
- status `(String)`:
  - **queued** Teads platform has put the report in the queue to be processed, this stage may vary depending on our resources availability
  - **processing** The report is now being computed
  - **error** An issue prevented the report from being computed, please look at message field for more details
  - **finished** The report is now finished, you can download the result at url field.
  - **killed** The report was canceled during its process
- start `(Timestamp ISO 8601)`: timestamp when the report request was registered in Teads backend
- reportProgress `(Object)`: object containing report progress
  - stepMax `(Number)`: number of steps to finish report
  - step `(Number)`: current step in the report
  - progressMax `(Number)`: max progress to finish step
  - progress `(Number)`: current progress in the step

+ Request (application/json)
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer {{OAuth bearer token}}

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
        "id": "abcdefgh-cff2-4753-a08b-ee4587de4e9d",
        "start": "2020-12-14T16:35:05.269Z",
        "lastStatusUpdate": "2020-12-14T16:35:05.269Z",
        "status": "processing",
        "valid": true,
        "reportProgress": {
          "stepMax": 4,
          "step": 1,
          "progress": 1,
          "progressMax": 2
          }
        }

+ Response 404 (text)

        The requested resource could not be found but may be available again in the future.

## List processing reports [GET /running/list]
List reports that are currently processing.

**Response JSON body attributes (list may not be exhaustive):**

`list[(Object)]`:
- id `(String)`:  unique identifier
- status `(String)`:
  - **queued** Teads platform has put the report in the queue to be processed, this stage may vary depending on our resources availability
  - **processing** The report is now being computed
- start `(Timestamp ISO 8601)`: timestamp when the report request was registered in Teads backend

+ Request (application/json)
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer {{OAuth bearer token}}

+ response 200 (application/json)

        [
            {
                "id": "abcdefgh-cff2-4753-a08b-ee4587de4e9d",
                "status": "processing",
                "start": "2020-01-28T07:37:55.273Z"
            }
        ]

## Cancel processing report [PUT /custom/{id}/kill]
Cancel a report that is currently processing

**Response JSON body attributes (list may not be exhaustive):**

- status `(String)`:
  - **killed** The report was canceled during its process
- id `(String)`: unique identifier

+ Request (application/json)
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer {{OAuth bearer token}}

+ response 200 (application/json)

         {
           "status": "killed",
           "id": "{{report_id}}"
         }

+ response 400 (application/json)

        {
          "status" : 400,
          "msg" : "REPORTING.ERROR.APPLICATION_NOT_FOUND"
        }
